  StyleBox["leadContactPoints", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "d64aae1f-72ad-524b-9d16-4d51c8bb0ace"],
 " and expands through geometric nearest-neighbor connections."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->1676758366,ExpressionUUID->"0c9b6856-5775-7b45-883b-b39aa355347d"],

Cell["\<\
Returns an association of point lists ordered from the deepest reachable \
layer to the lead-contact layer. Preserve this order when constructing \
scattering-region blocks.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->931096888,ExpressionUUID->"25758d9e-9bc6-fe4b-a46b-07b2b046055f"],

Cell["\<\
Only the component reachable from the lead contacts is included. Verify that \
the total returned site count equals the intended scattering-region site \
count.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1116348065,ExpressionUUID->"a644eac6-fb31-bf43-b87e-1aa7ec7d7663"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Coordinates may be labeled with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["Rule"]], "paclet:ref/Rule"},
   "RefLink",
   BaseStyle->{"InlineFormula"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "fbc3e31d-cedc-dd49-98fb-6d39c173d14a"],
 " expressions; the geometric search uses their coordinate values."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->1898988043,ExpressionUUID->"cca0bdb8-6fd0-5c47-a20e-0ed5c92f6bd7"]
}, Closed]],

